            <Info>
Experience the weatherproof moving heads of the beamZ Nereid series. This series of professional outdoor moving heads guarantees durability and top performance, thanks to its weatherproof IP65 design that can handle any environment. With powerful motors that ensure smooth and fast movements, these moving heads offer precise positioning like no other.
The Nereid series brings any event to life with vibrant colours, dynamic effects and impressive light output. Whether for concerts, festivals, outdoor events or architectural applications - this series brings every event to life. Thanks to their clear operation and energy efficiency, they meet all your lighting needs without compromising on versatility and creativity.
Light up your world with the beamZ Nereid Series and make every event an unforgettable experience!</Info>
            <Info type="Revision" date="2025-03-14T11:04:50.723">nereid760, Uploaded to Fixture Share.</Info>
